  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Whether via a thunderous blow from a great axe, an earth shattering bolt of supernatural energy, or a well aimed shove in a direction where the enemy's balance is weak, you knock the target off their feet. Knockdown is a favorite of hulking brutes, telekinetisists, martial artists, and earth elementalists.</p>",
    "powerLevel": 1,
    "invocationTime": "1 Major Action",
    "duration": "Instantaneous",
